Package: csmvisualizer
Type: Package
Title: Visualize Cropping System Model Structure and Simulated Output
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      c("Phillip", "D"), "Alderman",
      email = "phillip.alderman@okstate.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: A collection of functions for visualizing cropping system model
    structure as stock-flow diagrams, dependency graphs of model variables
    and plots of curves for model equations. Functions are also included to
    facilitate plotting of output simulated from cropping system models.
License: GPL-3
